## 3. Technology Stack

### Frontend (Phase 1)
- **Framework:** React 18
- **Build Tool:** Vite 8
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS 3.4 (custom meteorological dark command-center theme)
- **Routing:** React Router v6
- **Geospatial Mapping:** Leaflet 1.9 + React Leaflet 4.2 (CartoDB DarkMatter tiles)
- **Telemetry Charts:** Recharts 2.12 (Composed, Area, and Line charts)
- **HTTP Client:** Axios 1.7 (with transparent mock data fallback)
- **Icons:** Lucide React

### Backend (Phase 2 Target)
- **Language:** Python 3.11+
- **Framework:** Django 5.x & Django REST Framework (DRF)
- **Database:** PostgreSQL with PostGIS / GIS extensions
- **CORS:** `django-cors-headers`
- **Environment Management:** `python-dotenv` / `django-environ`

### Deep Learning & Inference (Phase 4/5 Target)
- **Framework:** PyTorch & Torchvision
- **Backbone Architectures:** ResNet-50 / EfficientNet-B4 (Feature Extractor)
- **Temporal Prediction:** CNN + LSTM/GRU (movement displacement & intensity trend)
- **Target Satellite Formats:** INSAT-3D/3DR (ISRO MOSDAC HDF5/GeoTIFF), NOAA AVHRR/VIIRS, NASA GPM IMERG

